      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "家を売って、誰も知らないところへ\n引っ越そうかなって思ってるんだ。\nねえ、誰かいい買い手さんがいないかな？\nもし、良さそうな人に会ったら、教えてよ！",
        "official_en": "I'm starting to think maybe I should sell the house\nand start a life somewhere brand new. But I want\nsomeone nice to live there. If you meet anybody you\nthink might be a good fit, please let me know!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
