      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "え！　家を探してる人が居た！？\nふんふん、なんだかいい感じの人そうだね。\n僕からも話してみるよ。何から何まで\nいろいろと、本当にありがとう！",
        "official_en": "There's someone looking to buy a house like mine?\nAnd they seem nice? Hmmm... I'm going to go talk\nto them! Thank you for everything! Take care!",
